sequenceDiagram
  participant O as Operator
  participant P as primary
  participant BE as ScrubBackend
  participant R as Damaged replica
  O->>P: ceph pg repair 2.1f
  P->>P: operator_forced: urgency = must_repair
  P->>BE: deep scrub of all chunks
  BE->>BE: select_auth_object ⇒ healthy shard
  BE->>P: repair_object(soid, ok_peer, bad_peers) ⇒ force_object_missing
  P->>P: add to missing, and missing_loc with the healthy source only
  P->>R: push from the authoritative copy
  R-->>P: PushReply
  P->>P: mark repaired, update stats
